# Go build output at the repository root only. An unanchored `bin/` also
# swallowed sdks/rhinoq/bin, whose three CLI shims are hand-written source:
# they existed on one machine and in no clone, so publishing the `rhinoq`
# package from a fresh checkout would have shipped three bin entries pointing
# at files that were not there.
/bin/
coverage/
.gocache/
*.tgz

